<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell 19 points to 1,392.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell 19 points to 1,392.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,392 today from 1,411 on April 15, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates</p>
<p>in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1420    12.894	  1440    13.071</p>
